# Deny by default. A blocklist can never list every secret file. This can.
# To publish a new file, add a matching "!" line below. Nothing else ships.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!README.md
!tmux/tmux.conf
!ghostty/config
!starship/starship.toml
!neovim/**/*.lua
!neovim/*.json
!neovim/stylua.toml
!neovim/LICENSE
!assets/*.svg
!assets/*.png
